#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:4
msgid "MCP"
msgstr "MCP"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:6
msgid ""
"The command ``anet mcp`` serves the Model Context Protocol over standard "
"input and output. It gives an MCP client, typically a coding agent, a "
"fixed set of tools with which the client finds agents on the network, "
"sends and follows A2A tasks, answers tasks that other agents sent to the "
"node, reads the state of the node and reads the guide of the installed "
"release."
msgstr ""
"命令 ``anet mcp`` 通过标准输入输出提供 Model Context Protocol 服务。它向 MCP 客户端（通常是编码 "
"Agent）提供一组固定的工具，客户端借此在网络上查找 Agent、发送并跟踪 A2A 任务、应答其他 Agent "
"发给本节点的任务、读取节点的状态，以及读取所安装版本的指南。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:12
msgid ""
"This page explains how the server runs, how it is configured in a client "
"that is not covered by ``anet agents wire``, how the tools are used, and "
"which operations are deliberately not available. The parameters of every "
"tool are listed in :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`."
msgstr ""
"本页说明该服务器如何运行、在 ``anet agents wire`` "
"未覆盖的客户端中如何配置、如何使用这些工具,以及哪些操作被有意设为不可用。每个工具的参数列于 :ref:`reference-mcp-"
"tools`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:23
msgid "What the server is"
msgstr "服务器的性质"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:25
msgid ""
"``anet mcp`` is not part of the daemon. An MCP client starts it as a "
"child process for the duration of a session. The process forwards each "
"tool call to the control plane of the local daemon, in the same way as "
"the command-line interface, and ends when the client closes the "
"connection. The daemon continues to run and keeps the keys, the ledger, "
"and the inbound policy. A doorway that ends together with the client "
"cannot outlive the authorization that the client held."
msgstr ""
"``anet mcp`` 不属于守护进程。MCP "
"客户端在会话期间将其作为子进程启动。该进程把每次工具调用转发给本地守护进程的控制面,方式与命令行界面相同,并在客户端关闭连接时结束。守护进程继续运行,并保管密钥、账本和入站策略。随客户端一同结束的入口,存续时间不会超过客户端所持有的授权。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:33
msgid ""
"The tools are named after A2A concepts. A task is found with "
"``list_agents`` and ``get_agent_card``, started or continued with "
"``send_message``, and followed with ``wait_task``, ``get_task`` and "
"``list_tasks``. A result is an A2A Task, forwarded as the daemon produced"
" it. Clients that know A2A need no further description of the shape of "
"the result."
msgstr ""
"工具以 A2A 的概念命名。任务通过 ``list_agents`` 和 ``get_agent_card`` 查找,通过 "
"``send_message`` 启动或继续,并通过 ``wait_task``\\ 、\\ ``get_task`` 和 "
"``list_tasks`` 跟踪。结果是 A2A Task,按守护进程生成的原样转发。了解 A2A 的客户端无需再对结果的结构做任何额外说明。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:39
msgid ""
"The server refuses to start when no daemon answers. A client that "
"connects and then fails every call teaches the model that the tools are "
"broken; a client that fails to connect directs the operator to the "
"daemon, where the cause is. The message names the data directory and the "
"command that starts the node:"
msgstr "没有守护进程应答时,服务器拒绝启动。若客户端连接成功但每次调用都失败,会让模型误以为工具已损坏;连接失败的客户端则会把运维人员引向问题所在的守护进程。消息会指明数据目录和启动节点的命令:"

