#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:70
msgid ""
"At least 900 seconds is recommended where the client documents a setting;"
" see :ref:`howto-mcp-waiting`. Gemini CLI takes ``timeout`` in "
"milliseconds (``900000``); Trae takes ``RUN_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS`` in the "
"environment. Many clients document no setting; there the default wait of "
"``wait_task`` applies"
msgstr ""
"客户端文档载明相应设置时,建议至少 900 秒,参见 :ref:`howto-mcp-waiting`。Gemini CLI 的 "
"``timeout`` 以毫秒计(\\ ``900000``);Trae 通过环境变量 ``RUN_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS`` "
"设置。许多客户端未载明相应设置,此时适用 ``wait_task`` 的默认等待时间"

