msgstr "在使用 ``mcpServers`` JSON 格式的客户端中,条目如下:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:90
msgid ""
"An MCP client does not load the shell profile of the operator. The "
"absolute path and ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` make the entry independent of the "
"environment of the client."
msgstr "MCP 客户端不会加载运维人员的 shell 配置文件。绝对路径和 ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 使条目不依赖于客户端的环境。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:95
msgid "Identity selection"
msgstr "身份选择"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:97
msgid ""
"A machine can hold several identities (``anet id ls``). When an identity "
"is selected explicitly, by ``--id``, ``ANET_ID``, ``ANET_HOME``, "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR``, or a non-default ``anet id use``, ``anet mcp`` "
"resolves strictly: it connects to the daemon of that identity and to no "
"other. A client that is configured for one identity cannot end up driving"
" another one, for example the daemon that was started last."
msgstr ""
"一台机器可以持有多个身份(``anet id ls``)。通过 ``--id``\\ 、\\ ``ANET_ID``\\ 、\\ "
"``ANET_HOME``\\ 、\\ ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 或非默认的 ``anet id use`` 显式选择身份时,\\ "
"``anet mcp`` "
"严格解析:只连接该身份的守护进程,不连接其他任何守护进程。因此,为某个身份配置的客户端,不会最终操控另一个身份,例如最后启动的那个守护进程。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:105
msgid "Token rotation"
msgstr "令牌轮换"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:107
msgid ""
"The daemon replaces its control token when it restarts and after an "
"emergency key rotation. ``anet mcp`` runs as long as the session of the "
"client. When a call is answered with HTTP status 401, the server looks "
"for the daemon of the same identity again, and if the token file holds "
"another token for the same address, it repeats the call once. A session "
"therefore continues without a restart. A daemon at another address is "
"never followed."
msgstr ""
"守护进程在重启时以及紧急密钥轮换之后,会替换其控制令牌。\\ ``anet mcp`` 的运行时间与客户端会话一样长。当调用收到 HTTP 状态 "
"401 "
"时,服务器会重新查找同一身份的守护进程;若令牌文件中同一地址的令牌已不同,则重试该调用一次。因此会话无需重启即可继续。服务器不会跟随位于其他地址的守护进程。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:116
msgid "The tool set"
msgstr "工具集"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:118
msgid ""
"The set contains exactly 15 tools. It does not change with the build "
"variant or with the modules that are available on the node; a tool whose "
"function depends on an unavailable module answers with the reason "
"``module_absent``."
msgstr ""
"工具集恰好包含 15 个工具。它不随构建变体或节点上可用的模块而变化；功能依赖于不可用模块的工具，会以原因码 ``module_absent`` "
"应答。"

