msgstr "等待运维人员批准的任务的元数据:发送方、时间、大小、请求 CID、能力标识。不包含内容。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:176
msgid "``guide``"
msgstr "``guide``"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:177
msgid ""
"The guide of the installed release, by topic (``overview``, ``setup``, "
