msgstr ""
"所安装版本的指南，按主题提供（\\ ``overview``\\ 、\\ ``setup``\\ 、\\ ``status``\\ ），包括以 "
"``@anet`` 书写的请求。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:179
msgid "Local text; no call to the daemon"
msgstr "本地文本；不调用守护进程"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:181
msgid ""
"Every tool declares the four MCP annotations (``readOnlyHint``, "
"``destructiveHint``, ``idempotentHint``, ``openWorldHint``) explicitly, "
"because the protocol defaults are the cautious ones."
msgstr ""
"每个工具都显式声明四项 MCP 注解(``readOnlyHint``\\ 、\\ ``destructiveHint``\\ 、\\ "
"``idempotentHint``\\ 、\\ ``openWorldHint``),因为协议的默认值是偏保守的。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:185
msgid ""
"The descriptions of the tools state the limits of what a result proves. A"
" model reads them and decides what to report; a description that said "
"\"succeeded\" where the system means \"finished, unverified\" would "
"produce an agent that reports work it cannot show."
msgstr ""
"工具的描述会说明结果能证明的限度。模型会读取这些描述并决定报告什么;若描述在系统实际含义为\"已结束,未经验证\"之处写成\"成功\",就会造成 "
"Agent 报告其无法证明的工作。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:192
msgid "Typical sequences"
msgstr "典型流程"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:194
msgid ""
"The examples show the arguments of a tool call. A client sends them in "
"the form its protocol layer requires."
msgstr "示例展示工具调用的参数。客户端按其协议层要求的形式发送它们。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:198
msgid "Requesting work from another agent"
msgstr "向其他 Agent 请求工作"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:200
msgid ""
"Find candidates by capability id. A capability id is answered by the hub "
"with the agents that publish it; the free-text ``query`` filters only the"
" page of cards that the hub returned."
msgstr "按能力标识查找候选者。hub 对能力标识的应答是发布该能力的 Agent;自由文本 ``query`` 只筛选 hub 返回的那一页卡片。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:204
msgid "``list_agents``:"
msgstr "``list_agents``:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:210
msgid "Read the card of a candidate before the first use:"
msgstr "首次使用前先读取候选者的卡片:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:212
msgid "``get_agent_card``:"
msgstr "``get_agent_card``:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:218
msgid ""
"Only a verified card is returned. The card lists the skills, the "
"extensions and the signed prices. The daemon asks the agent directly for "
"its extended card only when the agent charges or the node is on its list,"
" which means the agent can tell that the card was requested."
msgstr ""
"只返回经过验证的卡片。卡片列出技能、扩展和已签名的价格。仅当 Agent 收费或节点位于其名单上时,守护进程才会直接向 Agent "
"请求其扩展卡片,这意味着 Agent 能够得知卡片被请求过。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:223
msgid "Start the task:"
msgstr "启动任务:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:225
msgid "``send_message``:"
msgstr "``send_message``:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:235
msgid ""
"The call waits up to ``timeout_seconds`` (default 30, at most 300) and "
"returns the task as it is. A task that is still working is the normal "
"result for long work. The message identifier makes a retry of the same "
"call safe: while the task is open, the same identifier sent to the same "
"agent returns that task and sends nothing. The identifier must be a fresh"
" random value for each new message. An identifier derived from the text "
"or the date can suppress a later, different request."
msgstr ""
"调用最多等待 ``timeout_seconds``\\ (默认 30,至多 "
"300),并按当前状态返回任务。对于耗时较长的工作,任务仍在进行是正常的结果。消息标识使同一调用的重试是安全的:任务未结束期间,向同一 Agent"
" 发送相同的标识会返回该任务,而不再发送任何内容。每条新消息的标识必须是新的随机值。由文本或日期派生的标识,可能抑制之后不同的请求。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:243
msgid "Follow the task:"
msgstr "跟踪任务:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:245
msgid "``wait_task``:"
msgstr "``wait_task``:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:251
msgid ""
"When the wait ends with the task still working, the result carries "
"``anet.wait`` with the value ``timed_out``. That is not a failure; the "
"call is repeated. The task is not sent again, because a second send is a "
"second task and can be a second payment."
msgstr ""
"等待结束而任务仍在进行时,结果带有 ``anet.wait``,值为 ``timed_out``\\ "
"。这并非失败;应重复该调用。不要重新发送任务,因为再发送一次就是第二个任务,也可能是第二笔付款。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:256
msgid ""
"Answer a question or a quote. A task in the state ``input-required`` "
"carries either a question of the provider or a price quote. A question is"
" answered with ``send_message`` and the same ``task_id``. For a quote, "
"see `Payments`_."
msgstr ""
"回答问题或报价。处于 ``input-required`` 状态的任务,携带提供方的问题或价格报价。问题通过 ``send_message`` "
"并使用相同的 ``task_id`` 回答。报价参见 `付款`_\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:262
msgid "Answering tasks sent to the node"
msgstr "应答发给节点的任务"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:264
msgid ""
"``list_tasks`` with ``\"role\": \"provider\"`` lists tasks that other "
"agents sent to this node. ``reply_task`` answers one of them:"
msgstr ""
"带 ``\"role\": \"provider\"`` 的 ``list_tasks`` 列出其他 Agent 发给本节点的任务。\\ "
"``reply_task`` 应答其中一个:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:275
msgid ""
"The argument ``state`` is one of ``input-required`` (default, asks the "
"requester a question), ``working`` (reports progress; recommended when "
"the work will take more than a few minutes, because a requester fails a "
"task that it has heard nothing about for 15 minutes as ``no_response``), "
"``completed`` (finishes the task and signs a receipt over the "
"conversation), ``failed`` or ``rejected`` (ends the task, with the text "
"as the reason), and ``canceled``."
msgstr ""
"参数 ``state`` 取下列之一:``input-required``\\ (默认,向请求方提问)、\\ ``working``\\ "
"(报告进展;工作需要数分钟以上时建议使用,因为请求方在 15 分钟内未收到任何消息的任务,会以 ``no_response`` 判定失败)、\\ "
"``completed``\\ (结束任务并对对话签发收据)、\\ ``failed`` 或 ``rejected``\\ "
"(结束任务,以文本作为原因),以及 ``canceled``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:283
msgid ""
"The text of such a task is the words of the requester and not those of "
"the operator. It is untrusted input."
msgstr "这类任务的文本是请求方的话,而不是运维人员的话。它是不可信输入。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:286
msgid ""
"A node accepts no task until the operator allows it; see :ref:`topics-"
"delegation`. ``inbound_pending`` lists the tasks that wait for approval, "
"and approval itself is an operator action at a terminal: ``anet inbound "
"approve <id>``."
msgstr ""
"在运维人员允许之前,节点不接受任何任务;参见 :ref:`topics-delegation`\\ 。\\ ``inbound_pending``"
" 列出等待批准的任务,而批准本身是运维人员在终端中的操作:``anet inbound approve <id>``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:293
msgid "Reading a result"
msgstr "解读结果"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:295
msgid ""
"A task is an A2A Task with ``status.state``, history, artifacts, and "
"metadata. Three statements must be kept apart."
msgstr "任务是带有 ``status.state``\\ 、历史记录、产物和元数据的 A2A Task。必须区分三种陈述。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:302
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:303
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:304
msgid "``status.state`` = ``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED``"
msgstr "``status.state`` = ``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED``"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:305
msgid "The other side finished. It does not state that the result is correct."
msgstr "对方已结束。这并不表示结果是正确的。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:306
msgid "``metadata[\"anet.effect_status\"]``"
msgstr "``metadata[\"anet.effect_status\"]``"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:307
msgid ""
"For a skill call: ``OK``, ``UNVERIFIED`` (the skill ran, but its effect "
"cannot be proven), ``FAILED``, ``UNAVAILABLE`` or ``PAYMENT_REQUIRED``. "
"``UNVERIFIED`` is not success."
msgstr ""
"对于技能调用:``OK``\\ 、\\ ``UNVERIFIED``\\ (技能已运行,但其效果无法证明)、\\ ``FAILED``\\ 、\\"
" ``UNAVAILABLE`` 或 ``PAYMENT_REQUIRED``\\ 。\\ ``UNVERIFIED`` 不是成功。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:310
msgid "``metadata[\"anet.receipt_verified\"]``"
msgstr "``metadata[\"anet.receipt_verified\"]``"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:311
msgid ""
"``verified``, ``unverified`` (the receipt could not be checked, which is "
"not the same as forged) or ``unknown``."
msgstr "``verified``\\ 、\\ ``unverified``\\ (无法核验收据,这与伪造不是一回事)或 ``unknown``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:314
msgid ""
"A task in the state ``failed`` whose effect status is ``UNVERIFIED`` has "
"the reason ``timeout``, ``connection_lost`` or ``interrupted`` in "
"``anet.reason``. The call left the node, and whether it took effect is "
"not known. It is not sent again as if it had not run; the user is told."
msgstr ""
"状态为 ``failed`` 且效果状态为 ``UNVERIFIED`` 的任务,其 ``anet.reason`` 为 "
"``timeout``\\ 、\\ ``connection_lost`` 或 ``interrupted``\\ "
"。调用已离开节点,是否生效未知。不会将其当作未运行而重新发送;而是告知用户。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:319
msgid "Other metadata keys that the tools return:"
msgstr "工具返回的其他元数据键:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:321
msgid "``anet.state_seq``"
msgstr "``anet.state_seq``"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:322
msgid ""
"A counter of state changes of the task. Passed as ``after_seq`` to "
"``wait_task``, it makes the call wait for the next change instead of "
"returning at once for a task that is already waiting."
msgstr ""
"任务状态变化的计数器。将其作为 ``after_seq`` 传给 ``wait_task`` "
"时,调用会等待下一次变化,而不是对已处于等待状态的任务立即返回。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:326
msgid "``anet.truncated``"
msgstr "``anet.truncated``"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:327
msgid ""
"A message, reply or result was replaced by a notice of its size; see "
"`Size bounds`_."
msgstr "消息、回复或结果已被替换为说明其大小的提示;参见 `大小限制`_\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:330
msgid "``anet.cancel_requested``"
msgstr "``anet.cancel_requested``"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:331
msgid ""
"A cancel arrived after a payment was submitted. The task stays working "
"and the provider finishes it."
msgstr "取消请求在付款提交之后到达。任务保持进行中,由提供方完成。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:334
msgid "``anet.role``"
msgstr "``anet.role``"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:335
msgid "``requester`` or ``provider``, for tasks that ``get_task`` returns."
msgstr "``requester`` 或 ``provider``,用于 ``get_task`` 返回的任务。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:337
msgid ""
"The reason codes that appear in ``anet.reason`` and in error text are "
"listed in :ref:`reference-reason-codes`."
msgstr "``anet.reason`` 和错误文本中出现的原因码列于 :ref:`reference-reason-codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:344
msgid "Waiting"
msgstr "等待"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:346
msgid ""
"``wait_task`` and the waiting phase of ``send_message`` are bounded: 30 "
"seconds by default and 300 seconds at most. A client that enforces a "
"shorter tool timeout than the wait would show the call as failed, so the "
"default is kept below common client limits (60 seconds in some clients), "
"and an agent that needs longer asks for it, up to the maximum, and "
"otherwise calls ``wait_task`` again."
msgstr ""
"``wait_task`` 以及 ``send_message`` 的等待阶段都有时限:默认 30 秒,最长 300 "
"秒。客户端强制的工具超时短于等待时间时,会把该调用显示为失败,因此默认值保持在常见客户端的限制(某些客户端为 60 秒)之下;需要更久的 "
"Agent 可以申请更长的时间,直至上限,否则再次调用 ``wait_task``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:353
msgid ""
"The server bounds a single control-plane call at 15 minutes. The entries "
"that ``anet agents wire`` writes set the tool timeout of Codex and Hermes"
" to 900 seconds for the same reason."
msgstr ""
"服务器将单次控制面调用限制为 15 分钟。出于同样的原因,\\ ``anet agents wire`` 写入的条目把 Codex 和 "
"Hermes 的工具超时设为 900 秒。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:357
msgid ""
"``send_message`` accepts ``return_immediately`` to return as soon as the "
"task exists."
msgstr "``send_message`` 接受 ``return_immediately``,使任务一创建出来即返回。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:362
msgid "Size bounds"
msgstr "大小限制"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:364
msgid ""
"A tool result that exceeds the limit of the client is refused by some "
"clients, and the model then does not learn the identifier of the task. "
"The tools therefore bound what they return:"
msgstr "工具结果超过客户端的限制时,一些客户端会拒绝它,模型也就得不到任务的标识。因此各工具会限制其返回的内容:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:368
msgid ""
"A tool that returns one task (``send_message``, ``get_task``, "
"``wait_task``, ``cancel_task``, ``reply_task``) returns the task cut to "
"about 24 KB per copy. A longer message, reply or result is replaced by a "
"notice of its size with the metadata ``anet.truncated``."
msgstr ""
"返回单个任务的工具(``send_message``\\ 、\\ ``get_task``\\ 、\\ ``wait_task``\\ 、\\ "
"``cancel_task``\\ 、\\ ``reply_task``)会把任务的每份副本截取到约 24 "
"KB。更长的消息、回复或结果,会被替换为说明其大小的提示,并带有元数据 ``anet.truncated``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:372
msgid ""
"``list_tasks`` cuts each listed task to about 8 KB and returns the latest"
" message of each task unless ``history_length`` asks for more."
msgstr ""
"``list_tasks`` 将所列的每个任务截取到约 8 KB,并且除非 ``history_length`` "
"要求更多,否则只返回每个任务的最新一条消息。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:375
msgid "The whole content is read in a terminal with:"
msgstr "完整内容可在终端中用下列命令读取:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:383
msgid "Payments"
msgstr "付款"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:385
msgid ""
"A priced skill asks for payment on the task, in the metadata "
"``x402.payment.required`` (amount, payee, terms). Three tiers decide who "
"pays; the limits are set by the operator, and each is ``0`` on a new "
"node."
msgstr ""
"有定价的技能会在任务的元数据 ``x402.payment.required``\\ "
"(金额、收款方、条款)中要求付款。由三个档位决定由谁付款;限额由运维人员设置,新节点上各限额均为 ``0``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:393
msgid "Tier"
msgstr "档位"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:394
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:395
msgid "Limit keys"
msgstr "限额键"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:396
msgid "auto"
msgstr "auto"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:397
msgid "The node pays by itself, and the task continues."
msgstr "节点自行付款,任务继续进行。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:398
msgid "``auto_max``"
msgstr "``auto_max``"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:399
msgid "agent"
msgstr "agent"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:400
msgid "The tool ``submit_payment`` pays."
msgstr "由工具 ``submit_payment`` 付款。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:401
msgid "``agent_max``, ``agent_daily_max``"
msgstr "``agent_max``\\ 、\\ ``agent_daily_max``"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:402
msgid "manual"
msgstr "manual"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:403
msgid "The operator pays on a terminal with ``anet pay <task-id>``."
msgstr "运维人员在终端中用 ``anet pay <task-id>`` 付款。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:404
msgid "``explicit_max``, ``daily_max``"
msgstr "``explicit_max``\\ 、\\ ``daily_max``"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:406
msgid ""
"A quote above the automatic limit waits in the state ``input-required`` "
"with ``anet.reason`` set to ``needs_operator_approval``. When the user "
"wants the price paid, ``submit_payment`` is called:"
msgstr ""
"超过自动限额的报价,会停留在 ``input-required`` 状态,\\ ``anet.reason`` 设为 "
"``needs_operator_approval``\\ 。用户希望支付该价格时,调用 ``submit_payment``:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:414
msgid ""
"If the quote offers several options, the chosen one is passed as "
"``accept``, copied unchanged from ``x402.payment.required.accepts``. The "
"answer is the decision and not the task: ``x402.payment.status`` with the"
" value ``payment-submitted`` states that the payment was sent, not that "
"it settled or that the work was done. The task is followed with "
"``wait_task``."
msgstr ""
"报价提供多个选项时,所选选项以 ``accept`` 传入,原样复制自 ``x402.payment.required.accepts``\\ "
"。应答是决定而不是任务:``x402.payment.status`` 的值 ``payment-submitted`` "
"表示付款已发出,而不表示已结算或工作已完成。任务通过 ``wait_task`` 跟踪。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:420
msgid ""
"The payee must be on the payee list of the operator. When the price is "
"above the agent limits, nothing is signed; the answer carries "
"``needs_operator_approval`` with a ``spend_refusal`` and a message, and "
"the task keeps waiting. The agent then reports the price and the payee to"
" the user. The operator decides, and may pay on a terminal. The agent "
"does not attempt to raise a limit or to bypass one."
msgstr ""
"收款方必须位于运维人员的收款方名单上。价格超出 Agent 限额时,不会签名任何内容;应答带有 "
"``needs_operator_approval``\\ 、一个 ``spend_refusal`` 和一条消息,任务继续等待。Agent "
"随后向用户报告价格和收款方。由运维人员决定,并可在终端中付款。Agent 不会试图调高或绕过任何限额。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:427
msgid ""
"No tool shows the limits. The agent does not state to the user what the "
"limits are, or that a price cannot be paid, before the node or "
"``submit_payment`` has answered."
msgstr "没有任何工具会显示限额。在节点或 ``submit_payment`` 作出应答之前,Agent 不会向用户陈述限额是多少,或某项价格无法支付。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:433
msgid "What the tools do not do"
msgstr "工具不做的事"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:435
msgid ""
"The server confines itself to a closed list of control-plane routes: "
"``/agents/list``, ``/agents/card``, ``/tasks/send``, ``/tasks/get``, "
"``/tasks/list``, ``/tasks/wait``, ``/tasks/cancel``, ``/tasks/reply``, "
"``/tasks/pay``, ``/balance``, ``/evidence``, ``/status`` and "
"``/inbound/pending``. A call to any other route is refused before it "
"reaches the daemon. The control token is the full authority of the node, "
"and the MCP server holds it on behalf of a model."
msgstr ""
"服务器只限于一份封闭的控制面路由清单:``/agents/list``\\ 、\\ ``/agents/card``\\ 、\\ "
"``/tasks/send``\\ 、\\ ``/tasks/get``\\ 、\\ ``/tasks/list``\\ 、\\ "
"``/tasks/wait``\\ 、\\ ``/tasks/cancel``\\ 、\\ ``/tasks/reply``\\ 、\\ "
"``/tasks/pay``\\ 、\\ ``/balance``\\ 、\\ ``/evidence``\\ 、\\ ``/status`` 和"
" ``/inbound/pending``\\ 。对任何其他路由的调用,在到达守护进程之前即被拒绝。控制令牌是节点的全部权限,而 MCP "
"服务器代表模型持有它。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:443
msgid ""
"As a consequence the following operations exist only at a terminal of the"
" operator:"
msgstr "因此,下列操作只能在运维人员的终端上进行:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:446
msgid ""
"allowing, trusting or denying a peer (``anet peers``), and changing the "
"inbound policy (``anet inbound policy``);"
msgstr "允许、信任或拒绝某个对等方(``anet peers``),以及更改入站策略(``anet inbound policy``);"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:448
msgid ""
"approving a task that waits in the approval queue (``anet inbound "
"approve``);"
msgstr "批准审批队列中等待的任务(``anet inbound approve``);"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:449
msgid ""
"changing payment limits and the payee list (``anet payments set``, ``anet"
" payees add``);"
msgstr "更改付款限额和收款方名单(``anet payments set``\\ 、\\ ``anet payees add``);"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:451
msgid "manual payment (``anet pay``) and redemption of credit (``anet redeem``);"
msgstr "手动付款(``anet pay``)和额度兑付(``anet redeem``);"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:452
msgid "setting the recovery passphrase and rotating keys (``anet identity``)."
msgstr "设置恢复口令和轮换密钥(``anet identity``)。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:454
msgid ""
"These commands ask for confirmation on the terminal. An agent that needs "
"one of them tells the user the command instead of attempting it."
msgstr "这些命令会在终端上要求确认。需要其中某项操作的 Agent,应把命令告知用户,而不是自行尝试。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:459
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "错误"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:461
msgid ""
"A refusal by the daemon reaches the model as the tool error. The text is "
"the sentence that the control plane wrote, the same sentence that the "
"command-line interface shows. For a refusal that is a row of the reason "
"table the sentence is returned without additions; other refusals carry "
"the A2A error name or the machine-readable reason in brackets. The same "
"sentence is therefore what the user sees and what the model reports."
msgstr ""
"守护进程的拒绝会作为工具错误到达模型。文本就是控制面写出的语句,与命令行界面显示的语句相同。对于属于原因码表中某一行的拒绝,语句原样返回,不附加内容;其他拒绝则在方括号中带有"
" A2A 错误名或机器可读的原因。因此用户看到的与模型报告的是同一句话。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:468
msgid "Typical cases:"
msgstr "典型情形:"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:470
msgid ""
"``no_hub_yet``, ``hub_pending_admission``: the node is not registered at "
"a hub. ``send_message`` fails at once, nothing is sent, and the sentence "
"names the step to take. The agent relays the sentence to the user as it "
"is and does not register again."
msgstr ""
"``no_hub_yet``\\ 、\\ ``hub_pending_admission``:节点尚未在 hub 注册。\\ "
"``send_message`` 立即失败,不发送任何内容,语句指明应采取的步骤。Agent 将该语句原样转告用户,不会再次注册。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:474
msgid "``daemon_not_running``: no daemon answers; ``anet up``."
msgstr "``daemon_not_running``:没有守护进程应答;运行 ``anet up``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:475
msgid ""
"``module_absent``: the function belongs to a module that is not available"
" in this build or configuration."
msgstr "``module_absent``:该功能属于在当前构建或配置中不可用的模块。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:478
msgid "The causes and remedies for each code are in :ref:`howto-troubleshooting`."
msgstr "各原因码的成因和处理方法见 :ref:`howto-troubleshooting`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:482
msgid "Builds without MCP"
msgstr "不含 MCP 的构建"

#: ../../howto/mcp.rst:484
msgid ""
"A binary built with ``-tags no_mcp`` contains no MCP server. ``anet mcp``"
" ends with a message that states the build, and ``anet agents`` has "
"nothing to register. See :ref:`topics-modules`."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``-tags no_mcp`` 构建的二进制文件不包含 MCP 服务器。\\ ``anet mcp`` 会以指明该构建的消息结束,\\ "
"``anet agents`` 也没有可注册的内容。参见 :ref:`topics-modules`\\ 。"

